{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>肥媽在《今個夏天食平D》節目中教做這道「麻辣雞絲粉皮」！這道菜結合了綠豆粉皮的爽口彈牙，以及酸辣濃郁的自製特製麻辣醬汁，令人一試難忘！只要掌握醬汁提味的小技巧，在家也能輕鬆做出大酒樓級數的麻辣雞絲粉皮！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c6e0a18f-3fbe-44f2-bee1-ee7ae28afb23.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026IqnAvMJA701790137683.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c6e0a18f-3fbe-44f2-bee1-ee7ae28afb23.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'>主要食材：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><p id=\"p-rc_2fc7916fadcc9aed-1324\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;